exports[`the calendars page > explains a Google calendar zone mismatch using the default schedule rather than the profile in en 1`] = `"This Google calendar uses America/New York; your availability uses America/Los Angeles. Bookings land at the same moment; Google Calendar usually shows them in America/New York time. Review availability time zone"`;

exports[`the calendars page > explains a Google calendar zone mismatch using the default schedule rather than the profile in zh-CN 1`] = `"此 Google 日历使用 America/New York 时区；你的可预约时段使用 America/Los Angeles 时区。预约对应同一时刻；Google 日历通常以 America/New York 时间显示。 查看可用时间的时区"`;
